---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import CollectionHeader from '../components/ui/CollectionHeader.astro';
---
<MainLayout title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility features, current limitations and how to report a barrier on Dzaleka Online Services.">
  <CollectionHeader title="Accessibility" description="Help using Dzaleka Online Services and reporting anything that gets in your way." />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_300px] lg:gap-16">
      <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-3xl prose-a:text-primary-800">
        <h2>Using this website</h2>
        <p>Dzaleka Online Services is a community-run website. Its main navigation can be used with a keyboard. A “Skip to main content” link appears when you first press Tab, and forms have labels for their fields.</p>
        <p>You can use your browser’s zoom and text-size settings. The main layouts adapt to small screens. Some tables and maps need horizontal movement.</p>
        <h2>Other ways to read</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/easy-read">Easy read</a> offers short guides in simpler English.</li>
          <li><a href="/essentials">Newcomer essentials</a> is available in English, French, Swahili and Chichewa, with offline downloads and a print option.</li>
          <li><a href="/languages">Language information</a> explains the language resources linked from this site.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Current limitations</h2>
        <p>We have not completed an independent accessibility audit of the whole website and do not claim full WCAG conformance.</p>
        <p>Older articles, images and documents may have gaps in their text alternatives or structure. External maps, embedded media, application forms and documents are provided by other organisations, and their accessibility varies. Most pages are still in English.</p>
        <p>If you cannot use the interactive map, try the <a href="/services">service directory</a> or <a href="/site-register">site register</a> for locations and contact details in text.</p>
        <h2>Report a problem or request another format</h2>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:dzalekaconnect@gmail.com">dzalekaconnect@gmail.com</a> or use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. Include the page address, what you were trying to do and the format you need. You can mention your browser or assistive technology if it helps explain the problem.</p>
        <p>Do not send medical records, identity documents or other private information. The page feedback form can also be used to report a general accessibility problem.</p>
        <p class="text-sm">Statement published <time datetime="2026-09-28">28 September 2026</time>.</p>
      </article>
      <aside class="border-t-4 border-primary-800 pt-5">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Reading options</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 divide-y divide-slate-200">{[{ href: '/easy-read', label: 'Easy read guides' }, { href: '/essentials', label: 'Guides in four languages' }, { href: '/search', label: 'Search the website' }, { href: '/contact', label: 'Contact the site team' }].map(link => <li><a href={link.href} class="flex min-h-[52px] items-center py-3 text-primary-800 underline underline-offset-4">{link.label}</a></li>)}</ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
